recommend check-in (Keaton) -- three words wanted: a tools/f helper that seats call rather than kill, so %541 stops firing; whether a lap may tool the shelf sort after twelve hand repairs of %440; and the star's 4.79 against its 10.6x repair, still uncarried. The map work needs no ruling -- BAKERY can take trace-and-compare, and the union rule keeps the hand's judgment whole.
